; claude: image processing, what a photo editor's menus and tools do
; (plan_photoshop.md): point operations (Lut, Histogram, Hsl), the
; neighbourhood's (Convolve, Gaussian, Sobel, Median, Add_noise),
; geometry (Scale), selections (Mask, Composite) and painting (Brush,
; Gradient), over Rgba_image, each operation giving a new image. Pure
; OCaml, no Playground; TinyPhotoshop (apps/graphics/) is its program.
; Tests in graphics/tests/ (Unit_imaging).
